OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,FThe RSPB is celebrating conservation
OL,8,Fsuccess after ospreys bred at one of
OL,9,Fthe charity's nature reserves in
OL,10,FEngland for the first time.
OL,12,FA pair of the rare birds of prey
OL,13,Fsuccessfully hatched three chicks at
OL,14,FRSPB Campfield Marsh, a wetland on the
OL,15,Fshores of the Solway Firth in Cumbria,
OL,16,Fin June, the nature charity said.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
