OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786537137
OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,FThe species was persecuted to
OL,8,Fextinction as a breeding bird in the
OL,9,Fearly 20th century, but returned to
OL,10,FScotland ` now a stronghold for
OL,11,Fospreys ` in the 1950s and have
OL,12,Frecolonised other parts of the UK,
OL,13,Fwith an estimated 316 pairs across the
OL,14,Fcountry.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786537137
OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,FThe reserve at Campfield Marsh has an
OL,8,Fosprey platform to attract the birds
OL,9,Fof prey and the adults who have nested
OL,10,Fthere are thought to be first-time
OL,11,Fparents, with the male ringed in
OL,12,FDumfries in 2021 and a female whose
OL,13,Fage and origin are unknown, the RSPB
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FEggs were laid between 30 April and 6
OL,17,FMay, and once the chicks hatched in
OL,18,FJune a local primary school helped
OL,19,Fname them Ash, Bowness Bobbi and Beau.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786537137
OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,FThey have been ringed, and are
OL,8,Fexpected to fledge in August, but are
OL,9,Flikely to remain in the area learning
OL,10,Fto fish and fend for themselves before
OL,11,Fstarting the weeks-long migration to
OL,12,FAfrica from September.
OL,14,FMhairi Maclauchlan, site manager at
OL,15,FRSPB Campfield Marsh, said: "We are
OL,16,Fincredibly excited to be the first
OL,17,FRSPB reserve in England to host a pair
OL,18,Fof breeding ospreys.
OL,26,@wD@]OU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
