PN,32506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786537137
OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,F"We were on tenterhooks after the eggs
OL,8,Fwere laid and throughout the
OL,9,Fincubation period until they hatched.
OL,10,FThere was huge collective sigh of
OL,11,Frelief when they did.
OL,13,F"Osprey parents are surprisingly
OL,14,Ftender despite their large size and
OL,15,Fsharp talons.
OL,17,F"They can also offer good comedic
OL,18,Fvalue with nest tidying exploits and
OL,19,Fantics.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
