PN,32507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786537137
OL,3,CFirst osprey breeding at RSPB nature
OL,4,Creserve in England 'incredibly'
OL,5,Cexciting
OL,7,F"Ospreys are frequently site and
OL,8,Fpartner faithful, so we're hoping to
OL,9,Fsee more of them and their offspring
OL,10,Fin the future."
OL,12,FThe leg rings the chicks have been
OL,13,Ffitted with will allow any further
OL,14,Fsightings of the young birds once they
OL,15,Fhave fledged to be recorded and help
OL,16,Fmonitor their movements.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@OO]
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
